  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AudioSubtitleController
  voiceAudioSource: {fileID: 298068498}
  voiceClips:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89fa01eedbf5fd64caff2fa1463a7ed1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a9ee697a7440f546ab1f48b1bd7520d, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd429f7f34c75f14eb8c32601435226a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93a587983dd4b5a46b071e9f7b6395a8, type: 3}
  voiceSubtitles:
  - critic
  - critic
  - critic
  - critic
  promptSubtitles:
  - I want to understand you. What are you trying to do for me when you speak like
    that? What are you afraid would happen if you went quiet?
  - 'And what if you stopped pushing so hard: what are you most afraid of?'
  - 'Thank you for telling me. You''ve been trying to protect me: from humiliation,
    from being found out and you must be exhausted. You''re not bad, and you''re
    not a problem. You''re a part of me that has been scared for me.

    You don''t
    have to work this hard anymore. You can rest. I''m not asking you to disappear.
    I''m asking if you''ll let me take some of the weight from you?'
  - Yes. I've got us. If I ever need your care about doing things well, you can offer
    it gently. You were never the enemy. You were just scared.
  subtitleBackground: {fileID: 119400522}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 823701311}
  subtitleScrollRect: {fileID: 96967684}
  playFirstClipOnStart: 1
  delayBeforePrompt: 0
  autoScrollDuringAudio: 1
  autoScrollStartDelay: 1
  autoScrollEndPadding: 0.3
